"When a model download finishes or fails while OmniVoice is in the background, notify you with a system notification" = "模型下载完成或失败时，如果 OmniVoice 不在前台，用系统通知提醒";
"When listening to foreign speech, the local model detects the language being spoken" = "听外语时由本地模型判断对方说的语种";
"When off, it no longer appears automatically at launch; it still shows when live transcription starts, and can be opened from the Menu bar" = "关闭后启动时不再自动弹出；开始转录时仍会显示，也可从菜单栏打开";
"When on, the text recognized by each dictation (not window titles or anything else) is sent to the OpenAI-compatible service configured below for polishing. With a local Ollama it never leaves this Mac." = "开启后，每次语音输入识别出的文字（不含窗口标题或其他内容）会发送到下面配置的 OpenAI 兼容服务进行润色。选用本地的 Ollama 则不会离开这台 Mac。";
"When on, what you said is first handed to an LLM you configure yourself (an OpenAI-compatible API, or Ollama on this Mac) to add punctuation, remove filler words, and tidy lists before it is entered. The recognized text is sent to that service. Off by default." = "开启后，说完的话在输入前先交给你自己配置的 LLM（OpenAI 兼容接口，也可用本机 Ollama）补标点、去口癖、整理列表；识别出的文字会发送到该服务，默认关闭。";
"When the cached source text reaches half this many characters and hits a sentence break (period, question mark, line break), the cached text is translated early; once it reaches the full threshold it is translated even without a break, so long sentences don't stall. Lower values show text sooner but split long sentences into more parts; higher values keep each part more complete but may wait longer." = "缓存的原文达到该字数的一半、且遇到句号/问号/换行等断句点时，会提前把已缓存内容翻译一次；达到完整阈值后，即使还没遇到断句点也会强制翻译，避免长句迟迟不出字。数值越低出字越快，但长句越容易被拆成更多段；数值越高单段更完整，但可能等得更久。";
"When you start speaking, music that is playing (such as Music) or video in your browser (such as YouTube) pauses automatically, and resumes once your text has been entered, so the audio isn't recorded. It only resumes what it paused itself." = "开始说话时，正在播放的音乐（如 Music）或浏览器里的视频（如 YouTube）会自动暂停，文字输入完成后自动继续播放，声音不会被录进去；只会继续由它暂停的内容。";
"Why is “Auto-detect” unavailable?" = "为什么“自动检测”不可用";
"With the “press once to start, press again to stop” trigger, press Return when you finish speaking: the text is entered and Return is pressed automatically, so chat messages and prompts go out in one step. Finishing with the trigger key only enters the text, without pressing Return." = "在「按一下开始，再按一下结束」的触发方式下，说完直接按 Return：文字输入后自动回车，聊天消息、提示词一步发出；按触发键结束则只输入文字，不回车。";
"With the “press once to start, press again to stop” trigger, what you say can be translated into a foreign language before it is entered: review the translation in the bubble, then press Return to enter and send, press the trigger key to only enter, press Esc to discard, or click “Type Original”." = "在「按一下开始，再按一下结束」的触发方式下，可以把你说的话先翻译成外语再输入：说完先在气泡里看译文，Return 输入并发送，触发键只输入，Esc 放弃，也可以点「输入原文」。";
